---
// SAT · Public Offer (inglizcha nusxa, P23 davomi, 2026-11-11). Asosiy matn: /uz/oferta/. QORALAMA.
// Qaysi til yuridik kuchga ega: yurist javobi kerak (sahifada aytilgan).
import BolimQobiq from '../../../../../layouts/BolimQobiq.astro';
import HuquqiyMatn from '../../../../../components/huquqiy/HuquqiyMatn.astro';
import { huquqiyOchiq } from '../../../../../data/huquqiySahifalar';
import { yol } from '../../../../../lib/yol';

const { sotuvchi, voyagaYetmaganTolov } = huquqiyOchiq;
---
<BolimQobiq
  title="Public Offer · SAT"
  description="Terms for buying Tayanch SAT paid plans (draft)."
  turi="qollanma"
  bolim="sat"
  yol={['Legal']}
  holat="qoralama"
>
  <HuquqiyMatn
    til="en"
    kalit="oferta"
    sana="2026-11-11"
    kirish="This offer covers the paid plans on the plans page."
    tekshirish={[
      'Seller details (sole trader or company name, taxpayer number, address): from the author.',
      'Whether the inPAY merchant agreement requires a specific language or clauses for the offer.',
      'Which language version is legally binding (Uzbek, Russian, English).',
      'The matching articles of the Civil Code and the Consumer Protection Law: no article numbers are given yet.',
      'Whether a digital service needs an electronic receipt or invoice.',
    ]}
  >
    <h2>1. Parties</h2>
    <p>
      Seller:
      {sotuvchi
        ? <> {sotuvchi.nomi}, taxpayer number {sotuvchi.stir}, address: {sotuvchi.manzil}.</>
        : <> <span class="tekshir">to be checked</span> (name, taxpayer number and address are awaited from the author).</>}
    </p>
    <p>Buyer: a user with a Tayanch account who pays for a plan.</p>

    <h2>2. Accepting the offer</h2>
    <p>When you complete payment on the plans page, you accept this offer in full. The offer is accepted at the moment the payment succeeds.</p>

    <h2>3. The service</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>The service: use of the paid plan features in the SAT section of the Tayanch site (for example question quota and extended results) for the chosen period.</li>
      <li>The plan contents, price and period are shown on the <a href={yol('/uz/sat/hisob/obuna/')}>plans page</a> before you pay. The terms shown at the time of payment apply.</li>
      <li>The plan is switched on in your account automatically once the payment is confirmed.</li>
      <li>The subscription covers only the SAT section and does not unlock other sections.</li>
      <li>Tayanch does not guarantee a score, admission or a scholarship.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>4. Payment</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Payment is in Uzbek so'm, through inPAY with Click or Payme. Tayanch never sees your card details.</li>
      <li>There is no automatic recurring payment yet: when the period ends, you pay again if you want to continue.</li>
      <li>
        {voyagaYetmaganTolov === null
          ? <>Buyers under 18: <span class="tekshir">to be checked</span> (author and lawyer decision).</>
          : voyagaYetmaganTolov === 'faqat-18'
            ? <>The buyer must be 18 or older.</>
            : <>If you are under 18, pay with your parent's or guardian's consent and their payment method.</>}
      </li>
    </ul>

    <h2>5. Refunds</h2>
    <p>Refund terms are on a separate page: <a href={yol('/uz/sat/huquqiy/qaytarish/')}>Refund Policy</a>.</p>

    <h2>6. Obligations</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Seller: provides the plan features for the paid period and protects personal data under the <a href={yol('/uz/sat/huquqiy/maxfiylik/')}>Privacy Policy</a>.</li>
      <li>Buyer: follows the <a href={yol('/uz/sat/huquqiy/shartlar/')}>Terms of Use</a>, does not share the account and does not distribute paid materials.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>7. Disputes</h2>
    <p>Disputes are first settled by talking to us: <a href={yol('/uz/sat/huquqiy/aloqa/')}>Contact</a>. If that fails, they are handled under the law of the Republic of Uzbekistan. Exact procedure: <span class="tekshir">to be checked</span> (lawyer).</p>

    <h2>8. Changes</h2>
    <p>If the offer changes, the new date is shown at the top of this page. A period you already paid for ends under the terms in force at the time of payment.</p>
  </HuquqiyMatn>
</BolimQobiq>
